# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Env wiring for the self-hosted inference lanes. Copy the relevant vars into the
# platform's runtime env (NOT committed with real values). These are the ONLY
# switches needed — the gateway seams already read them.
#
# Referenced by:
#   server/services/ai-gateway/providers/clients.ts        (createLocalClient)
#   server/services/ai-gateway/embeddings/embedding-provider.ts (resolveEmbeddingProvider)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Generation lane ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Point the gateway's `local` provider at the self-hosted chat endpoint. When
# unset, the gateway simply has no local provider (no accidental activation).
LOCAL_AI_BASE_URL=http://vllm-generation:8000/v1
# Most self-hosted servers ignore the key, but set it so TLS/proxy front-ends
# that enforce one still work (pilot plan IQ).
LOCAL_AI_API_KEY=not-required
# Model the vLLM service loads (must match docker-compose LOCAL_GEN_MODEL).
LOCAL_GEN_MODEL=meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct
LOCAL_GEN_MAX_LEN=32000

# ── Embedding lane (offline RAG) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# HARD GATE — DO NOT set EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=local yet. The embedding seam has a
# SINGLE base URL today, so flipping it to `local` routes EVERY corpus — including
# the 3072-d documentVectors corpus — to one self-hosted endpoint. A 1536-d
# endpoint then breaks documentVectors inserts AND retrieval (dimension mismatch),
# with no error at write time. Enabling `local` is only safe AFTER the deferred
# per-corpus embedding routing / re-vectorization work lands (pilot plan Gate 1),
# and only when the 3072-d corpus is either served on frontier or provably unused.
# Until then, leave this commented so the runtime default (openai) stands and the
# generation lane can go on-prem independently (pilot plan Gate 0).
#
# EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=local
# EMBEDDING_LOCAL_BASE_URL=http://tei-embeddings-1536:8080/v1
# EMBEDDING_LOCAL_API_KEY=not-required
# The self-hosted embedding model id. Its output dimension MUST match the target
# corpus (1536-d for the 7 hot corpora only; the 3072-d documentVectors corpus is
# NOT servable here until Gate 1 — see the hard gate above).
# EMBEDDING_LOCAL_MODEL=intfloat/e5-mistral-7b-instruct

# ── Governance (keep ON for any tenant-facing on-prem use) ───────────────────
# PII/PHI screen in block mode on the local lane, exactly as on frontier lanes.
AI_PII_ENFORCEMENT=block

# ── Optional: HF token for gated model weights during IQ provisioning ────────
# HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN=
